# The phonon modes of cubic SrTiO3 (Pm-3m, 5 atoms, Sr at the origin) at GM, X,
# M and R, from the FORCE_SETS of a 4x4x4 supercell, with the Ti-O bonds and
# the TiO6 octahedra. Writes phonon_visualize.html and band_vector.yaml. The
# lowest level at R is imaginary (-1.09 THz, drawn in red): R5-, the antiphase
# rotation of the TiO6 octahedra (R4+ with Ti at the origin) that condenses in
# the 105 K transition to I4/mcm. Open phonon_visualize.html#q=R&mode=1&view=a
# to see its first partner down its rotation axis, and tick 'animate'. The
# second command adds the midpoints of the path segments (--all-irreps) and
# writes phonon_visualize_all.html.
crystod-phonon --visualize -c 221_PPOSCAR_SrTiO3 --dim 4 4 4 --bond Ti O 2.1

* Structure *
  Space group: Pm-3m (#221)
  Formula: SrTiO3
  Supercell: 4 x 4 x 4 (FORCE_SETS)

* Band path *
  k path (seekpath): GM-X-M-GM-R-X | R-M  (306 q points)
  Labeled points: X, GM, R, M

