# With --all-irreps (the pair of crystod-phonon --irreps --all-irreps): the same
# page plus the midpoint of every segment of the path, DT (GM-X), Z (X-M),
# SM (M-GM), LD (GM-R), S (R-X) and T (R-M), each with its ISO-IR line irreps
# (those of phonon_irreps_all.yaml), its own display cell (DT (0, 1/4, 0):
# 1 x 4 x 1 primitive cells) and a dot in the middle of its leg of the
# dispersion. Writes phonon_visualize_all.html (about 195 kB; band_vector.yaml
# again, unchanged). Open phonon_visualize_all.html#q=DT&mode=1&view=a for the
# transverse acoustic DT5 wave viewed down a; #q=DT(GM-X) and #q=5 (the fifth
# q button) open the same point.
crystod-phonon --visualize -c 221_PPOSCAR_SrTiO3 --dim "4 4 4" --bond Ti O 2.1 --all-irreps

