# Without --bond: the atoms and the arrows only. At GM the lowest optical
# level, GM4- [T1u] at 2.66 THz, is the soft polar mode of the incipient
# ferroelectric (the O octahedron against Ti and Sr); open
# phonon_visualize_plain.html#q=GM&mode=4&view=c
crystod-phonon --visualize -c 221_PPOSCAR_SrTiO3 --dim 4 4 4 -o phonon_visualize_plain.html
